      "evidence": "Fixed disposition verified: spec_review.py:150–153 parses the heading ID and line 182 compares it exactly. Lines 452–459 reject R, R-00 and R-0011 against R-001 and accept the colon-delimited heading."
    },
    {
      "id": "F2",
      "resolved": true,
      "evidence": "Fixed disposition verified: spec_review.py:201–214 counts resumptions independently of the reminder and refuses a paused response when six resumptions have already occurred. Lines 471–476 assert refusal after exactly seven requests, before a seventh resumption."
    },
    {
      "id": "F3",
      "resolved": true,
      "evidence": "Fixed disposition verified: spec_review.py:224–253 rejects missing or non-array findings fields and incomplete entries; line 266 validates before record writes. Lines 303–304 apply the same validation to stored findings. Regression cases appear at lines 477–484 and 506–509."
    },
    {
      "id": "F4",
      "resolved": true,
      "evidence": "Fixed disposition verified: spec_review.py:312–314 includes every passing item's ambiguity ID, requirements and question in the successful check message. Lines 501–505 assert the emitted content and nonblocking result."
    }
  ],
